{
    "title": "Evvnt",
    "description": "Evvnt\u2019s mobile box office app makes day-of management simple and efficient for events of any size. Built to support both at-the-door and advance ticket sales for your next event. Sell tickets on the spot with your preferred payment method, all from the palm of your hand, completing check-ins quickly so attendees get in and enjoy your event.\r\n\r\nEvvnt\u2019s mobile box office also includes additional tools to better manage your events. View sales and inventory information, control available ticket types, search orders, and more.\r\n\r\nEvvnt provides ticketing, management, and promotion of local events. Operating in the US and 139 countries worldwide, Evvnt forms the industry\u2019s largest events advertising network with 100m+ consumers, 250,000+ event creators, and 6,000+ event discovery calendars.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Evvnt\u2019s mobile box office app makes day-of management simple and efficient for events of any size. Built to support both at-the-door and advance ticket sales for your next event. Sell tickets on the spot with your preferred payment method, all from the palm of your hand, completing check-ins quickly so attendees get in and enjoy your event.<br><br>Evvnt\u2019s mobile box office also includes additional tools to better manage your events. View sales and inventory information, control available ticket types, search orders, and more.<br><br>Evvnt provides ticketing, management, and promotion of local events. Operating in the US and 139 countries worldwide, Evvnt forms the industry\u2019s largest events advertising network with 100m+ consumers, 250,000+ event creators, and 6,000+ event discovery calendars.",
